{"3273210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blunderous", "steam_appid": 3273210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273210/extras/6f5418f7a0e617eefc2d5cf3b48138b6.webp?t=1783759887\" width=616 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <strong><i>Blunderous</i></strong>, a good plan is all you need. Each round you buy cards and upgrades, then sit back and watch the battle unfold. Cards are simple on their own, it's all about finding the synergies between them. Become an unkillable tank, an explosive damage-dealer, or a money-printing machine, there are a number of ways to secure victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273210/extras/e35ae7d9cff885ea55579b74e1ace633.poster.avif?t=1783759887\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273210/extras/e35ae7d9cff885ea55579b74e1ace633.webm?t=1783759887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273210/extras/e35ae7d9cff885ea55579b74e1ace633.mp4?t=1783759887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273210/extras/558579495f540cbba17b36c2b624c4ce.webp?t=1783759887\" width=616 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It's not just about having a good team, it's about having the best. Drain your opponent's health before they do the same to you. Cards repeatedly trigger every few seconds, potentially triggering other card abilities on your team or your opponent’s. A single blunder can be the difference between an easy victory or a swift death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273210/extras/cb3c0400b51fa02050ce318fad4689d3.poster.avif?t=1783759887\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273210/extras/cb3c0400b51fa02050ce318fad4689d3.webm?t=1783759887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273210/extras/cb3c0400b51fa02050ce318fad4689d3.mp4?t=1783759887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273210/extras/5ce652fd03d8b5e9add0f04a93d3e226.webp?t=1783759887\" width=616 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In Arena mode, you battle a unique opponent each round. There’s no turn timer here, so take as long as you need to build the perfect hand. If you want to make things personal, the Head-to-Head mode lets you battle your friends with customizable rules and timers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273210/extras/4d49fde55ea7d1c7b034284f337083e1.poster.avif?t=1783759887\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273210/extras/4d49fde55ea7d1c7b034284f337083e1.webm?t=1783759887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273210/extras/4d49fde55ea7d1c7b034284f337083e1.mp4?t=1783759887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>&quot;They say the old Innkeeper still lives deep in the valley, obsessing over a mysterious card game that grants the victor whatever they desire. If he respects your desperation, he may indulge you in a game.&quot;</i></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273210/extras/6f5418f7a0e617eefc2d5cf3b48138b6.webp?t=1783759887\" width=616 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <strong><i>Blunderous</i></strong>, a good plan is all you need. Each round you buy cards and upgrades, then sit back and watch the battle unfold. Cards are simple on their own, it's all about finding the synergies between them. Become an unkillable tank, an explosive damage-dealer, or a money-printing machine, there are a number of ways to secure victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273210/extras/e35ae7d9cff885ea55579b74e1ace633.poster.avif?t=1783759887\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273210/extras/e35ae7d9cff885ea55579b74e1ace633.webm?t=1783759887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273210/extras/e35ae7d9cff885ea55579b74e1ace633.mp4?t=1783759887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273210/extras/558579495f540cbba17b36c2b624c4ce.webp?t=1783759887\" width=616 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It's not just about having a good team, it's about having the best. Drain your opponent's health before they do the same to you. Cards repeatedly trigger every few seconds, potentially triggering other card abilities on your team or your opponent’s. A single blunder can be the difference between an easy victory or a swift death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273210/extras/cb3c0400b51fa02050ce318fad4689d3.poster.avif?t=1783759887\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273210/extras/cb3c0400b51fa02050ce318fad4689d3.webm?t=1783759887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273210/extras/cb3c0400b51fa02050ce318fad4689d3.mp4?t=1783759887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273210/extras/5ce652fd03d8b5e9add0f04a93d3e226.webp?t=1783759887\" width=616 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In Arena mode, you battle a unique opponent each round. There’s no turn timer here, so take as long as you need to build the perfect hand. If you want to make things personal, the Head-to-Head mode lets you battle your friends with customizable rules and timers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273210/extras/4d49fde55ea7d1